  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">EVA폼으로 만든 어둠상자로&#160; 조명 색에 따른 물체의 색관찰 실험과 <br>딱풀 요요를 이용한 빛의 합성 실험을 올립니다. <br><br>이미 알고 계신분도 있겠지만<br>오랜 만에&#160; 다시 실험 해보니<br>실험결과가 100% 만족스럽지는 않지만</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">결과물을 만들어내는 고마운 학생들이 있어 소개합니다. </span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a33cf39b714272614c3ecbfc5214f3ffbe847153\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a33cf39b714272614c3ecbfc5214f3ffbe847153\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ce516e1698da81d82628a1ff576cefc94725239\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ce516e1698da81d82628a1ff576cefc94725239\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c083dc08f868e9381cc31eb69481c14381c0e977\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c083dc08f868e9381cc31eb69481c14381c0e977\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/afaefb06aa1a5cc106a2075abd2ea69dec2f52bb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/afaefb06aa1a5cc106a2075abd2ea69dec2f52bb\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9a350db5b87b89e73aea8f648a180e582f3be0ab\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9a350db5b87b89e73aea8f648a180e582f3be0ab\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/17aa2dc04f8bbe60a2b69e7467c5ae0c743f1d4f?download\" data-file-name=\"요요색의 합성3.xlsx\" data-file-size=\"42604\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D779%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20220916192109&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F17aa2dc04f8bbe60a2b69e7467c5ae0c743f1d4f')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">요요색의 합성3</span><span class=\"type\">.xlsx</span></div><div class=\"size\">41.61KB</div></div></a></div><p>어둠상자는 2019년 1월 인과사 실험연수에서 제공된 것입니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
